&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:2pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;地球環境に配慮した&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:2pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　持続可能な社会の実現&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:2pt;margin-top:2pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;●脅威・リスク&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:12.5pt;padding-right:2pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-4.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・地球温暖化、海洋汚染、森林破壊など&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:2pt;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;●機会&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:12.5pt;padding-right:2pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-4pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・地球環境の維持・改善&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:12.5pt;padding-right:2pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:2pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-4pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・環境負荷低減を目指した事業活動&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:11.9pt;padding-right:2pt;margin-top:2pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9.9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;●地球環境に配慮したサステナブルな社会への貢献&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:11.7pt;padding-right:2pt;margin-top:2pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9.7pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;●温室効果ガス排出低減(ISO14001)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:11.7pt;padding-right:2pt;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9.7pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;●3Rへの取り組み&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:11pt;padding-right:2pt;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;(つかう責任)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;
