&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:11pt;padding-right:2pt;margin-top:2pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:-0.5pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;●健康で快適に暮らせる包摂的(インクルージョン)な社会への貢献&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:11pt;padding-right:2pt;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:-0.5pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;●活気溢れる活性化された地域社会への貢献&lt;/p&gt;
